msgstr "CPU profile unavailable"

msgid "Power saving"
msgstr "Power saving"

msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Balanced"

msgid "Performance"
msgstr "Performance"

msgid "Cores capped at about 60 %% of their maximum (cooler, less power)."
msgstr "Cores capped at about 60 %% of their maximum (cooler, less power)."

msgid "Schedutil across the full hardware range (the stock behaviour)."
msgstr "Schedutil across the full hardware range (the stock behaviour)."

msgid "Every cluster pinned at its hardware maximum."
msgstr "Every cluster pinned at its hardware maximum."

msgid "CPU profile"
msgstr "CPU profile"

msgid "A profile sets the CPU governor and the per-cluster frequency limits. It stays within the hardware frequency table and never changes the voltage, so it cannot overclock this SoC. The kernel keeps throttling at its thermal limit in every profile."
msgstr "A profile sets the CPU governor and the per-cluster frequency limits. It stays within the hardware frequency table and never changes the voltage, so it cannot overclock this SoC. The kernel keeps throttling at its thermal limit in every profile."

msgid "Saved profile: %s"
msgstr "Saved profile: %s"

msgid "Thermal throttling is active right now: the frequencies below are below the profile ceiling."
msgstr "Thermal throttling is active right now: the frequencies below are below the profile ceiling."

msgid "Clusters"
msgstr "Clusters"

msgid "Cores"
msgstr "Cores"

msgid "Governor"
msgstr "Governor"

msgid "Now"
msgstr "Now"

msgid "Min"
msgstr "Min"

msgid "Max"
msgstr "Max"

msgid "Hardware max"
msgstr "Hardware max"

msgid "Frequencies in MHz."
msgstr "Frequencies in MHz."

msgid "Highlighted cores are online. A core taken offline stays offline, also after a reboot, until it is brought back. CPU0 always stays online."
msgstr "Fremhævede kerner er online. En kerne, der er slået fra, forbliver offline, også efter en genstart, indtil den slås til igen. CPU0 forbliver altid online."

msgid "Low latency: on"
msgstr "Lav latenstid: til"

msgid "Low latency: off"
msgstr "Lav latenstid: fra"

msgid "Low latency keeps CPU0 out of its idle states, as ZTE's U30 Air firmware does: Wi-Fi delays are much shorter, and the device draws more power. Off by default."
msgstr "Lav latenstid holder CPU0 ude af dens hviletilstande, ligesom ZTE's U30 Air-firmware: Wi-Fi-forsinkelser bliver meget kortere, og enheden bruger mere strøm. Fra som standard."

msgid "Thermal"
msgstr "Termisk"

msgid "The kernel's thermal zones, read only. A zone with trip points throttles the cooling devices bound to it at its passive trip; a cooling state of 0 is no throttling."
msgstr "Kernens termiske zoner, skrivebeskyttet. En zone med tærskelpunkter drosler de køleenheder, der er bundet til den, ved sit passive tærskelpunkt; køletilstand 0 betyder ingen drosling."

msgid "Zone"
msgstr "Zone"

msgid "Temperature"
msgstr "Temperatur"

msgid "Trip points"
msgstr "Tærskelpunkter"

msgid "Cooling devices"
msgstr "Køleenheder"

msgid "Stress test started"
msgstr "Stresstest startet"

msgid "Saved: it takes effect at the next reboot"
msgstr "Gemt: træder i kraft ved næste genstart"

msgid "CPU voltage offset (EXPERIMENTAL)"
msgstr "CPU-spændingsoffset (EKSPERIMENTEL)"

msgid "Experimental: changing the CPU voltage can make the device unstable, corrupt your data and permanently damage your device. Use it entirely at your own risk."
msgstr "Eksperimentel: ændring af CPU-spændingen kan gøre enheden ustabil, ødelægge dine data og beskadige din enhed permanent. Brug sker helt på egen risiko."

msgid "CPU voltage offset unavailable"
msgstr "CPU-spændingsoffset er ikke tilgængelig"

msgid "Not available with this kernel (a mainline kernel of this release or later has it)."
msgstr "Ikke tilgængelig med denne kerne (en mainline-kerne fra denne udgivelse eller senere har det)."

msgid "Off: the stock voltages"
msgstr "Fra: fabriksspændingerne"

msgid "Changes at the next reboot"
msgstr "Ændres ved næste genstart"

msgid "Trial boot: kept once this boot has been up 10 minutes"
msgstr "Prøveopstart: beholdes, når denne opstart har kørt i 10 minutter"

msgid "Kept: this offset passed its trial boot"
msgstr "Beholdt: denne offset bestod sin prøveopstart"

msgid "a boot with it ended without a clean shutdown"
msgstr "en opstart med den sluttede uden en ren nedlukning"

msgid "its trial boot ended before 10 minutes"
msgstr "dens prøveopstart sluttede før 10 minutter"

msgid "invalid value"
msgstr "ugyldig værdi"

msgid "unknown SoC firmware"
msgstr "ukendt SoC-firmware"

msgid "refused by the kernel"
msgstr "afvist af kernen"

msgid "the kernel could not start CPU scaling with it"
msgstr "kernen kunne ikke starte CPU-frekvensskaleringen med den"

msgid "Offsets in µV for the three CPU domains (cores 0-3, 4-6 and 7), in whole steps. A new offset takes effect at the next reboot, as a trial: it is kept once that boot has been up 10 minutes, and dropped (back to 0) if a boot with it ends in a crash, a watchdog reset or a power cut."
msgstr "Offsets i µV for de tre CPU-domæner (CPU-kerner 0-3, 4-6 og 7), i hele trin. En ny offset træder i kraft ved næste genstart, på prøve: den beholdes, når den opstart har kørt i 10 minutter, og droppes (tilbage til 0), hvis en opstart med den ender med et nedbrud, en watchdog-nulstilling eller en strømafbrydelse."

msgid "Running now (µV)"
msgstr "Kører nu (µV)"

msgid "Saved for the next boot (µV)"
msgstr "Gemt til næste opstart (µV)"

msgid "State"
msgstr "Tilstand"

msgid "Taken back automatically: %s µV (%s)"
msgstr "Automatisk trukket tilbage: %s µV (%s)"

msgid "The SoC firmware of this device is not one whose voltage encoding is known: only the stock voltages are possible."
msgstr "Enhedens SoC-firmware er ikke en, hvis spændingskodning er kendt: kun fabriksspændingerne er mulige."

msgid "Domain"
msgstr "Domæne"

msgid "Offset now (µV)"
msgstr "Offset nu (µV)"

msgid "Highest step"
msgstr "Højeste trin"

msgid "New offset (µV)"
msgstr "Ny offset (µV)"

msgid "Limits: %d to %d µV, in steps of %d µV."
msgstr "Grænser: %d til %d µV, i trin på %d µV."

msgid "Save for the next boot"
msgstr "Gem til næste opstart"

msgid "Each offset must be a multiple of %d µV between %d and %d."
msgstr "Hver offset skal være et multiplum af %d µV mellem %d og %d."

msgid "Type %s to confirm."
msgstr "Skriv %s for at bekræfte."

msgid "Back to the stock voltages"
msgstr "Tilbage til fabriksspændingerne"

msgid "Type %s to confirm:"
msgstr "Skriv %s for at bekræfte:"

msgid "Run a 10-minute CPU stress test"
msgstr "Kør en 10-minutters CPU-stresstest"

msgid "Test a new offset under load during its trial boot. The device may crash if the voltage is too low; the next boot then runs at the stock voltages."
msgstr "Test en ny offset under belastning under dens prøveopstart. Enheden kan gå ned, hvis spændingen er for lav; næste opstart kører så med fabriksspændingerne."

msgid "A stress test is running."
msgstr "En stresstest kører."

msgid "USB role"
msgstr "USB-rolle"

msgid "Current role"
msgstr "Aktuel rolle"

msgid "Switch USB role"
msgstr "Skift USB-rolle"

msgid "Device mode"
msgstr "Enhedstilstand"

msgid "Host mode"
msgstr "Værtstilstand"

msgid "Enable host mode at boot"
msgstr "Aktivér værtstilstand ved opstart"

msgid "Apply role"
msgstr "Anvend rolle"

msgid "Host mode disconnects USB networking and serial on this port. F50 has no battery; management may be lost and a USB adapter usually needs a powered hub."
msgstr "Værtstilstand afbryder USB-netværk og seriel forbindelse på denne port. F50 har intet batteri; administrationsadgangen kan gå tabt, og en USB-adapter kræver normalt en hub med egen strømforsyning."

msgid "USB network mode"
msgstr "USB-netværkstilstand"

msgid "Network protocol"
msgstr "Netværksprotokol"

msgid "Apply duration"
msgstr "Varighed"

msgid "Next reboot only"
msgstr "Kun næste genstart"

msgid "Permanent"
msgstr "Permanent"

msgid "Enable selected protocol"
msgstr "Aktivér valgt protokol"

msgid "Save; apply after reboot"
msgstr "Gem; anvend efter genstart"

msgid "NCM is the default. Windows does not natively support ECM; RNDIS changes enumeration. With Enable selected protocol off, only your choice is saved. Next reboot only applies once, then returns to NCM."
msgstr "NCM er standard. Windows understøtter ikke ECM indbygget; RNDIS ændrer enumereringen. Når Aktivér valgt protokol er slået fra, gemmes kun dit valg. Kun næste genstart anvendes én gang og vender derefter tilbage til NCM."

msgid "USB adapters"
msgstr "USB-adaptere"

msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "Opdater"

msgid "Available only in host mode. Refresh brings discovered USB adapters up; adding to LAN saves the bridge and reloads networking."
msgstr "Kun tilgængelig i værtstilstand. Opdater aktiverer fundne USB-adaptere; tilføjelse til LAN gemmer broen og genindlæser netværket."

msgid "Recent modem operations"
msgstr "Seneste modemhandlinger"

msgid "Show"
msgstr "Vis"

msgid "The control panel's recent calls, of this boot and the one before: when, which page call or AT command, how long it took and how it ended (ok, error, busy, killed). No values, replies or messages are kept. Useful when the panel was stuck."
msgstr "Kontrolpanelets seneste kald fra denne og den forrige opstart: hvornår, hvilket sidekald eller hvilken AT-kommando, hvor lang tid det tog, og hvordan det endte (ok, fejl, optaget, afbrudt). Der gemmes ingen værdier, svar eller beskeder. Nyttigt, når panelet hang."

msgid "Unavailable"
msgstr "Utilgængelig"

msgid "USB network mode is unavailable in host mode; host auto-start also disables USB network auto-start."
msgstr "USB-netværkstilstand er ikke tilgængelig i værtstilstand; automatisk start af værtstilstand deaktiverer også automatisk start af USB-netværk."

msgid "Host mode immediately disconnects USB management. F50 has no battery and peripherals may need external power; make sure another management path exists."
msgstr "Værtstilstand afbryder straks USB-administrationen. F50 har intet batteri, og eksterne enheder kan kræve ekstern strøm; sørg for, at der findes en anden administrationsadgang."

msgid "USB networking and serial will re-enumerate in device mode."
msgstr "USB-netværk og seriel forbindelse enumereres igen i enhedstilstand."

msgid "Switch USB role?"
msgstr "Skift USB-rolle?"

msgid "Apply"
msgstr "Anvend"

msgid "Switching USB role…"
msgstr "Skifter USB-rolle…"

msgid "Switch failed: %s"
msgstr "Skift mislykkedes: %s"

msgid "Management connection lost; reconnect to confirm the USB role."
msgstr "Administrationsforbindelsen blev afbrudt; genopret forbindelsen for at bekræfte USB-rollen."

msgid "Switch request accepted; the USB connection may briefly disconnect."
msgstr "Anmodningen om skift er modtaget; USB-forbindelsen kan blive afbrudt kortvarigt."

msgid "USB role applied"
msgstr "USB-rolle anvendt"

msgid "Save USB network mode?"
msgstr "Gem USB-netværkstilstand?"

msgid "The network mode applies on the next reboot; USB management may need to reconnect."
msgstr "Netværkstilstanden anvendes ved næste genstart; USB-administrationen skal muligvis genoprette forbindelsen."

msgid "Save the selection only; with the selected protocol disabled, the next boot still uses default NCM."
msgstr "Gem kun valget; når den valgte protokol er deaktiveret, bruger næste opstart stadig standard-NCM."

msgid "Save"
msgstr "Gem"

msgid "Saving USB network settings…"
msgstr "Gemmer USB-netværksindstillinger…"

msgid "Settings saved"
msgstr "Indstillinger gemt"

msgid "Save failed: %s"
msgstr "Gem mislykkedes: %s"

msgid "This boot"
msgstr "Denne opstart"

msgid "Previous boot"
msgstr "Forrige opstart"

msgid "Unable to confirm the role yet; reconnect and refresh the page."
msgstr "Rollen kan ikke bekræftes endnu; genopret forbindelsen, og opdater siden."

msgid "Switch to host mode to see USB adapters."
msgstr "Skift til værtstilstand for at se USB-adaptere."

msgid "Scanning USB adapters…"
msgstr "Søger efter USB-adaptere…"

msgid "No USB adapters found."
msgstr "Ingen USB-adaptere fundet."

